From: premohq <48417750+premohq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:51:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Find the Switch side's folders where /data refuses lstat

ShadowMountPlus 1.7 mounts /data into an app without a HEN with lstat refused (EPERM) and stat
answered. ecam_layout's Present took every refused path for one that is there: an install without
/data/ps5cemu/eden still looked for its files there, and PS5-ECAM's Reorganize could move nothing.
Status takes stat's answer there, as nothing on /data is a link. The same header as PS5-ECAM's
port/app/system_layout.h.
---
 headless/ecam_layout.h | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/headless/ecam_layout.h b/headless/ecam_layout.h
index 7b30290..bbe88b2 100644
--- a/headless/ecam_layout.h
+++ b/headless/ecam_layout.h
@@ -22,10 +22,18 @@ namespace ecam_layout
         const std::string parent = Parent(shared);
         return parent + (parent == "/" ? "" : "/") + system;
     }
+    // A path's own status, a link's rather than its target's. ShadowMountPlus 1.7 mounts /data into an
+    // app without a HEN with lstat refused (EPERM) and stat answered: there, stat's, as nothing on /data
+    // is a link
+    inline int Status(const std::string& path, struct stat& info)
+    {
+        if (lstat(path.c_str(), &info) == 0) return 0;
+        return errno == EPERM ? stat(path.c_str(), &info) : -1;
+    }
     inline bool Present(const std::string& path)
     {
         struct stat info{};
-        return lstat(path.c_str(), &info) == 0 || (errno != ENOENT && errno != ENOTDIR);
+        return Status(path, info) == 0 || (errno != ENOENT && errno != ENOTDIR);
     }
     inline bool Activated(const std::string& directory)
     {
